ID DIVISION. 
PROGRAM-ID. RTEST. 
PROCEDURE DIVISION. 
DISPLAY "entering: rtest".
CALL 'ADD-SUB'.
STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM RTEST.


IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ADD-SUB.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
   01 WS-FOR-ADD.
        02 WS-SUM       PICTURE S99V99.
        02 WS-ADDEND-1  PICTURE S99V99.
        02 WS-ADDEND-2  PICTURE S99V99.
   01 WS-FOR-SUBTRACT.
        02 WS-DIFFERENCE PICTURE S99V99.
        02 WS-MINUEND    PICTURE S99V99.
        02 WS-SUBTRAHEND PICTURE S99V99.
   01 TESTER.
        02 TESTER-02.
           10 TEST-1.
              20 BOB  PIC 9(9).
           10 TEST-2.
              20 BOB  PIC 9(9).
                 66 BILL RENAMES BOB OF TEST-2.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
   01 LS-ALPHABET PICTURE A(26).
PROCEDURE DIVISION. 
ADDITION.
MOVE 1.23 TO WS-ADDEND-1.
MOVE 3.21 TO WS-ADDEND-2.
CALL 'ADD-THEM' USING WS-FOR-ADD.
DISPLAY 'Addition result: (should be 4.44): ' WITH NO ADVANCING.
DISPLAY WS-SUM.

SUBTRACTION.
MOVE WS-FOR-ADD to WS-FOR-SUBTRACT.
MOVE WS-DIFFERENCE to WS-MINUEND.
CALL 'SUBTRACT-THEM' USING WS-FOR-SUBTRACT.
DISPLAY 'Subtraction result: (should be 1.23) ' WITH NO ADVANCING.
DISPLAY WS-DIFFERENCE.

PARA-ALPHABET.
CALL 'BUILD-ALPHABET' USING LS-ALPHABET.
DISPLAY LS-ALPHABET.

DONE.
GOBACK.
END PROGRAM ADD-SUB.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ADD-THEM.
DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 LS-Accumulator PICTURE S99V99.
LINKAGE SECTION.
   01 LK-MATH-PROBLEM.
        02 LK-RESULT    PICTURE S99V99.
        02 LK-PARAM-1   PICTURE S99V99.
        02 LK-PARAM-2   PICTURE S99V99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-MATH-PROBLEM.
DoTheAddition.
    MOVE LK-PARAM-1 TO LS-Accumulator.
    ADD  LK-PARAM-2 TO LS-Accumulator.
    MOVE LS-Accumulator TO LK-RESULT.
    GOBACK.
    END PROGRAM ADD-THEM.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SUBTRACT-THEM.
DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 LS-Accumulator PICTURE S99V99.
LINKAGE SECTION.
   01 LK-MATH-PROBLEM.
        02 LK-RESULT    PICTURE S99V99.
        02 LK-PARAM-1   PICTURE S99V99.
        02 LK-PARAM-2   PICTURE S99V99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-MATH-PROBLEM.
DoTheSubtraction.
    MOVE LK-PARAM-1 TO LS-Accumulator.
    SUBTRACT LK-PARAM-2 FROM LS-Accumulator.
    MOVE LS-Accumulator TO LK-RESULT.
    GOBACK.
    END PROGRAM SUBTRACT-THEM.
    
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BUILD-ALPHABET.
DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 LS-N PIC S9(9) COMP.
01 LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
01 LS-DUMMY PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
01 LS-ALPHABET .
    02 LS-LETTER-A PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-B PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-C PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-D PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-E PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-F PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-G PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-H PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-I PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-J PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-K PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-L PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-M PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-N PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-O PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-P PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-Q PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-R PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-S PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-T PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-U PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-V PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-W PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-X PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-Y PICTURE A.
    02 LS-LETTER-Z PICTURE A.
LINKAGE SECTION.
   01 LK-ALPHABET PICTURE A(26).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-ALPHABET.
BuildTheAlphabet.
PERFORM BuildLoop VARYING LS-N FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL LS-N=32.

    MOVE LS-ALPHABET TO LK-ALPHABET.
    GOBACK.
BuildLoop.
    *> N2 = N1 * 13 + 1 MOD 2^N is a reliable (albeit extremely poor!)
    *> 0 through 2^N-1 pseudo-random number generator
    MULTIPLY 13 BY LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE GIVING LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE.
    ADD 1 TO LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE.
    DIVIDE 32 INTO LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE GIVING LS-DUMMY ROUNDED REMAINDER LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  1 THEN MOVE 'A' TO LS-LETTER-A.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  2 THEN MOVE 'B' TO LS-LETTER-B.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  3 THEN MOVE 'C' TO LS-LETTER-C.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  4 THEN MOVE 'D' TO LS-LETTER-D.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  5 THEN MOVE 'E' TO LS-LETTER-E.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  6 THEN MOVE 'F' TO LS-LETTER-F.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  7 THEN MOVE 'G' TO LS-LETTER-G.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  8 THEN MOVE 'H' TO LS-LETTER-H.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE =  9 THEN MOVE 'I' TO LS-LETTER-I.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 10 THEN MOVE 'J' TO LS-LETTER-J.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 11 THEN MOVE 'K' TO LS-LETTER-K.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 12 THEN MOVE 'L' TO LS-LETTER-L.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 13 THEN MOVE 'M' TO LS-LETTER-M.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 14 THEN MOVE 'N' TO LS-LETTER-N.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 15 THEN MOVE 'O' TO LS-LETTER-O.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 16 THEN MOVE 'P' TO LS-LETTER-P.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 17 THEN MOVE 'Q' TO LS-LETTER-Q.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 18 THEN MOVE 'R' TO LS-LETTER-R.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 19 THEN MOVE 'S' TO LS-LETTER-S.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 20 THEN MOVE 'T' TO LS-LETTER-T.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 21 THEN MOVE 'U' TO LS-LETTER-U.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 22 THEN MOVE 'V' TO LS-LETTER-V.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 23 THEN MOVE 'W' TO LS-LETTER-W.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 24 THEN MOVE 'X' TO LS-LETTER-X.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 25 THEN MOVE 'Y' TO LS-LETTER-Y.
    IF LS-RANDOM-VARIABLE = 26 THEN MOVE 'Z' TO LS-LETTER-Z.
EndBuildLoop.
END PROGRAM BUILD-ALPHABET.
